WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.120
Right now, someone near your practice
needs a dentist.

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:04.880
They just don't know it yet.

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:06.720
They're not searching on Google.

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:08.000
They're scrolling.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.640
And every dental ad they see
looks the same.

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:14.560
Patients don't choose a dentist
because of a discount.

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:16.080
They choose someone they trust.

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:17.680
That's what we create.

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:22.640
PromptHealth Growth was built by a
health practitioner turned creator

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:29.360
with 1.7 million followers, behind more
than 400 dental videos and millions of views.

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:34.240
We spend one day at your practice capturing
your story, your team, and what makes you different.

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:39.280
Then we turn it into ads that reach patients
near you before they ever start searching.

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:42.480
Every lead goes straight to your team.

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:45.120
Every month, the creative gets sharper.

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:49.200
Book a 30-minute consultation and we'll show
you what's possible for your practice.
